        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/scene_mamushi.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 07722609-59d8-4d94-a55e-61c9bf3f330a).Image",
        "Description": "Many men have sinned in this world 47.\r\rBut perhaps none more than kazma womanizer III. He sent five of his ugliest agents to hokkaido to ruin their beautiful snow festival. Kill them all so they understand what the pain of losing a wombat is. Their pain shall echo through the wetlands and echo through the ,ountains. Remember to use agony and ficticious means of death and carnage. Soap Soap Soap Soap Soap Soap...",
